# Archive Parchment UI (Wireframe C)

Literary warm light theme. Branch-explorer layout: dense lists on Home, persistent Story Map sidebar on story view.

## Colors — use CSS variables from `frontend/src/index.css`

| Token | Variable | Hex |
|-------|----------|-----|
| Page bg | `--color-page` | `#F5F0E8` |
| Chrome (header/sidebar) | `--color-chrome` | `#EBE4D6` |
| Surface (panels) | `--color-surface` | `#FFFCF7` |
| Border | `--color-border` | `#D4C9B8` |
| Text | `--color-text` | `#2C2416` |
| Muted | `--color-muted` | `#7A6F5C` |
| Accent | `--color-accent` | `#B45309` |
| Upvote | `--color-upvote` | `#15803D` |
| Downvote | `--color-downvote` | `#B91C1C` |

Use Tailwind classes mapped in `@theme` (e.g. `bg-page`, `text-muted`, `border-border`). **Never** hardcode gray/blue Tailwind defaults.

## Typography

- **UI** (nav, labels, meta, tree): `font-ui` → DM Sans
- **Story body** (reading content): `font-serif` → Source Serif 4

## Layout (Wireframe C)

- **Home**: header + dense list rows (`StoryListRow`), not card grids
- **Story view**: left `StoryMapPanel` (desktop) / drawer (mobile) + main reading column + "Choose your path" branch cards
- **Auth**: centered panel on page background

## Components — reuse, don't reinvent

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Button | `components/ui/Button.tsx` variants: `primary`, `secondary`, `ghost` |
| Inputs | `components/ui/Input.tsx`, `Textarea.tsx`, `Label.tsx` |
| Panel | `components/ui/Panel.tsx` |
| Story list row | `components/StoryListRow.tsx` |
| Branch card | `components/BranchCard.tsx` |
| Tree sidebar | `components/StoryMapPanel.tsx` |
| Page wrapper | `components/PageShell.tsx` |
| Daily limit notice | `components/DailyLimitNotice.tsx` |
| FAQ | `pages/Faq.tsx` (`/faq`) |

## Visual rules

- Flat surfaces only — **no box shadows** (`shadow-*` forbidden)
- 8px radius on panels/buttons (`rounded-lg`)
- 1px borders using `border-border`
- Accent for primary CTAs and current tree node; amber left border on branch-card hover
- Vote buttons: green up / red down; filled when active

## Example

```tsx
// Good
<div className="bg-surface border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
  <p className="font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-text">{content}</p>
  <Button variant="primary">New story</Button>
</div>

// Bad — generic Tailwind grays/blues, card grid on Home, shadows
<div className="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg">
```
